  "generated": "---\ntitle: \"Add a participant to a conference\"\nslug: \"/apps/android-add-participant--revxed1mtc961qnyoj91m8rz\"\nmdx: {\"format\":\"md\"}\ntags: [\"Android\",\"General\",\"android\",\"working-with-calls\"]\n---\n\n*Looking for an&#x20;*[PC/Mac](/docs/apps/desktop-conference-calls--vaqva2dc377xnjga0me78u8p) *or&#x20;*[iOS](/docs/apps/ios-add-to-conference--pjkfi0mfezoimgar5qa4fzg0) *version of this article?*\n\nTo add a participant to a call:\n\n1. Tap the ‘More’ icon during an ongoing call to switch to the additional features set.\n2. Press the ‘**Add call**’ icon![App icon](/img/ringotel/original/94a5a1b6db1e872deea2/93d909b9212bdbc8a387fc18e028ff5327484508960a309c0347ba8df9d908dc.png)\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/3466f4d4d402f6414df0/5da6a9cb8100072b0ff7a4c5be44877f045e58d627cebf5cd9f3c48f6acc682c.png)\n\n1. Choose а contact that you’d like to add to a call from the list.\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/70b14d4f6f28b8ea0d94/e8a9d349f3659cad2ded7354fbcd686b12f38199baeec9f3c20f228ccb502a7d.png)\n\n*i. Tap the ‘Numpad’ icon to manually dial a phone number.*\n\n1. After you’ve connected with a new participant, press the ‘Merge’ button to add this participant to a conference.\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/14582d4ec900002dc81f/e4adcbd3b18d9c3504d03eda710b5f2e34747c8e361fb7a358177bb34998293d.png)\n\n*i. Press the ‘Merge’ button to merge both lines into a conference.*\n\nYou can repeat all the above steps to add more people to a conference call.\n\n\n\n\n\n## Related articles\n\n- [Making outgoing calls](/docs/apps/android-making-outgoing-calls--c4n9cbuhjtif2ymq8chdz387)\n- [Switching between two lines during a call](/docs/apps/android-switching-lines--c8e4jfo3wvtby5vkotervkh3)\n"
